                                "sense_id": "4fdc7d15-ccb1-35f0-a789-f0856240b5e5",
                                "text": "Their seductive colouring ebriates, and libertinism reigns triumphant."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2253244e-baed-4b3c-b1d3-0469d0263c56",
                                "sense_id": "4fdc7d15-ccb1-35f0-a789-f0856240b5e5",
                                "text": "Make me with Thy stripes sore-stricken, With Thy cross my spirit quicken— Ebriate—but not with wine: Cheer me, and with mercy brighten, Shield me, and my darkness lighten, When the Day of Doom shall shine."
